<title>GREECE: INTRACOM SIGNS 3.2BLN DRS DEAL WITH OPAP.</title>
<headline>INTRACOM SIGNS 3.2BLN DRS DEAL WITH OPAP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek telecoms manufacturer Intracom signed a 3.2 billion drachma deal with OPAP for &quot;on-line&quot; games and sports bets.</p>
<p>Intracom will revamp OPAP's computer system and upgrade terminals in OPAP agencies, it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
